      'Every year the Greater Good Science Center at UC Berkeley gathers the most compelling research on what makes life feel meaningful — not happy in the shallow sense, but worth living. Their 2025 round-up continues a pattern that has grown unmistakable across two decades of findings: meaning is built out of connection, contribution, and the stories we tell about our own lives.',
      '## The big three: belonging, purpose, and a coherent story',
